WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.688
The fictional customer reports payment, but the record still shows an unpaid balance.

00:00:04.688 --> 00:00:09.015
We stop the ordinary reminder path and preserve both pieces of information.

00:00:09.015 --> 00:00:10.457
The accounts coordinator investigates.

00:00:10.457 --> 00:00:12.621
The system may recommend a review.

00:00:12.621 --> 00:00:18.390
It may not decide that the customer is wrong, change the balance, or approve a refund.
